{"title":"Career Roadmap · Production Executive","role":"Production Executive","summary":"A Production Executive coordinates the practical execution of events, media productions, film/television projects, digital content, advertising productions, or other creative projects. Depending on the organisation, responsibilities can include scheduling, budgeting, vendor coordination, crew coordination, logistics, production documentation, location management and execution tracking.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Production Executive coordinates the practical execution of events, media productions, film/television projects, digital content, advertising productions, or other creative projects. Depending on the organisation, responsibilities can include scheduling, budgeting, vendor coordination, crew coordination, logistics, production documentation, location management and execution tracking."},{"type":"p","text":"A BBA in Event / Media / Film Business provides a useful business-oriented foundation for this career because production requires both creative-industry understanding and operational management."},{"type":"p","text":"The degree alone, however, is not sufficient. Production is highly execution-oriented, so internships, live projects, set/event exposure and production portfolios are particularly important."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Production fundamentals","Assistant/Coordinator","Production Executive","Production Manager","Senior Production Manager","Head of Production"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build production, event/media operations, budgeting and coordination skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Production Executive → Senior Production Executive / Product