n support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendee analytics"},{"text":"Personalised communication"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Audience engagement"},{"text":"Event forecasting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, AI does not eliminate the importance of human coordination, creative judgement, negotiation, safety and real-world execution."},{"type":"h","text":"Production Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"A student should graduate with a practical portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"One complete event"},{"text":"One short-film/video project"},{"text":"One digital content production project"},{"text":"One production budget"},{"text":"One production schedule"},{"text":"One risk-management plan"},{"text":"One vendor-management exercise"},{"text":"Production reports/documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, a portfolio showing what was actually executed is significantly stronger than a portfolio containing only theoretical assignments."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Media/Film Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Event/Media/Film Business","Production Intern / Production Assistant","Production Coordinator","Production Executive","Senior Production Executive","Production Manager / Line Producer","Senior Production Manager","Head of Production / Executive Producer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Event Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Event Production Intern","Event Production Executive","Event Manager","Senior Event Manager","Event Production Head","Business/Operations Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Production"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Crew coordination"},{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Location management"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Production documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":