 Manager / Line Producer"},{"text":"Budget + crew + project ownership"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Senior Production Manager"},{"text":"Multiple productions + leadership"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Head of Production / Executive Producer"},{"text":"Production strategy + commercial leadership"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For BBA Event / Media / Film Business → Production Executive, the strongest profile is an execution-oriented production professional with strong business and project-management skills. The student should not rely solely on classroom knowledge; this career rewards live production experience, reliability under deadlines, budgeting ability, vendor coordination and a documented portfolio of completed productions."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal graduation profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Event/Media/Film Business","Production Internship","Event/Film Experience","Scheduling","Budgeting","Vendor Management","Project Management","Excel","Media/Production Workflows","Risk Management","Communication","Production Portfolio","AI-Assisted Production Skills."],"sep":"+"}]}]}